                "content": "Inline HTML inside Markdown takes the macro too, so callouts can match Grafana's own alerts.\n\n<div style=\"margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 12px 16px; background: ${__theme.colors.info.transparent}; border: 1px solid ${__theme.colors.info.borderTransparent}; border-left: 4px solid ${__theme.colors.info.border}; border-radius: ${__theme.shape.radius.default}\">\n  <div style=\"color: ${__theme.colors.info.text}; font-weight: 500\">Info</div>\n  <div>Deploys are frozen from Friday 18:00 UTC.</div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 12px 16px; background: ${__theme.colors.success.transparent}; border: 1px solid ${__theme.colors.success.borderTransparent}; border-left: 4px solid ${__theme.colors.success.border}; border-radius: ${__theme.shape.radius.default}\">\n  <div style=\"color: ${__theme.colors.success.text}; font-weight: 500\">Resolved</div>\n  <div>Checkout latency is back under the 300 ms SLO.</div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 12px 16px; background: ${__theme.colors.warning.transparent}; border: 1px solid ${__theme.colors.warning.borderTransparent}; border-left: 4px solid ${__theme.colors.warning.border}; border-radius: ${__theme.shape.radius.default}\">\n  <div style=\"color: ${__theme.colors.warning.text}; font-weight: 500\">Degraded</div>\n  <div>The EU ingest queue is 12 minutes behind.</div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 12px 16px; background: ${__theme.colors.error.transparent}; border: 1px solid ${__theme.colors.error.borderTransparent}; border-left: 4px solid ${__theme.colors.error.border}; border-radius: ${__theme.shape.radius.default}\">\n  <div style=\"color: ${__theme.colors.error.text}; font-weight: 500\">Incident</div>\n  <div>Payments API returns 5xx for 4% of requests.</div>\n</div>\n",
                "mode": "markdown"
              },
              "fieldConfig": {
                "defaults": {},
                "overrides": []
              }
            }
          }
